        <div style="border-right: 1px solid var(--line-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 18px"><p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 600">Signed builds</p><p style="margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px">every release has checksums and GitHub build attestations</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid var(--line-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 18px"><p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 600">No telemetry</p><p style="margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px">nothing leaves your machine unless you export it</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid var(--line-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 18px"><p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 600">Asks before it installs</p><p style="margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px">backs up every file it changes; one command undoes it</p></div>
